{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：13:00 2026-08-12 HKT</p>\n\n<p>37歲何珮瑜近日在社交平台上，分享了數張在海灘拍攝的比堅尼泳照，偷得浮生。相中她身穿一套設計簡約的比堅尼泳衣，帶著她的白色愛犬「Fuji」，在沙灘上漫步，享受著難得的悠閒時光。從其中一張背影照片可見，她牽著小狗，在沙灘上留下一長串斜陽下的影子，身材惹火，散發出健康性感的美態。</p>\n<h2>何珮瑜擁有豐滿上圍極吸睛</h2>\n<p>何珮瑜一向以美好身材見稱，當年她身穿配上藍白幾何圖案，充滿夏日氣息的比堅尼，下半身泳褲的綁帶設計則為整體造型增添了幾分時尚感。在多張坐姿的近鏡相片中，豐滿上圍一覽無遺，而且清楚見到何珮瑜零贅肉小腹和緊實的腹部線條，陽光灑在她古銅色的肌膚上，更顯健康活力。</p>\n<img alt=\"何珮瑜有驕人身材及甜美樣貌，曾是宅男女神。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a20fb233eaf7021e274bba34a736b8a/2025-10/12_1_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何珮瑜大方分享比堅尼照，一邊吃著Pizza一邊展示零贅肉好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e689a380955227451e53e7dd090c33b1/2025-10/13_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何珮瑜拍攝過《喜愛夜蒲》、《一路向西》等多套電影，性感形象深入民心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/568a99fb292347990e213300cd21d2a0/2025-10/14_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何珮瑜與弟弟感情要好，日前飛卦澳洲參與畢業禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3494b4a1ace07314d200843000838d0c/2025-12/356_.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"何珮瑜見證弟弟大學畢業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41e99ba226bb4f3a5dd507a65c98206e/2025-12/357_.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"何珮瑜早年以𡃁模身份出道，曾經出過寫真。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/715b0760682c4c943aea2e42dfda26b1/2023-05/_3204000.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何珮瑜早年以𡃁模身份出道，曾經出過寫真。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec1b28ab5b6564e787479f07a60ce2fd/2023-05/_3206344.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何珮瑜早年以𡃁模身份出道，曾經出過寫真。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b21cb131ad551ce96ece9364b2a7bf8/2023-05/jeana_hidy_dvd_cover.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何珮瑜早年以𡃁模身份出道，曾經出過寫真。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be0d9d301e722233d82858029c0379fb/2023-05/_3202478_e.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早年形象性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0563588124c47eae253032673250ba7f/2023-05/839_xazb_34.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早年形象性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00dc0feb1ff439ea41f8655abc8cddeb/2023-05/839_xazb_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曾經拍過《喜愛夜蒲》系列。（東周刊圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6983c63ecbb2c2610d8c93b689bf75f9/2023-05/525_bcd_1_50_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"亦都有拍過TVB水著節目。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc1ea5670f71c581ec276f4a5b9747d2/2023-05/7v3x1390.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"亦都有拍過TVB水著節目。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bf7bb9c5fdc73bccf65ada9d19f8097/2023-05/7v3x1310.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曾經拍過《喜愛夜蒲》系列。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48b7191018f0892d49821bae8ae04999/2023-05/est2014213007212054m.jpg\"/>\n<h2>何珮瑜與愛犬「Fuji」溫馨互動</h2>\n<p>何珮瑜除了展示驕人身段，這輯相片的最大亮點莫過於她與愛犬「Fuji」之間的溫馨互動。在其中一張照片中，站在及膝的海水中，溫柔地將濕透的愛犬擁入懷中，臉上流露出滿足的笑容，畫面充滿愛意，原來這是狗狗「Fuji」首次到海邊玩耍，主人與狗也相當興奮。另一張相中，她則坐在沙灘墊上，雙手高舉愛犬，與牠深情對望，陽光勾勒出一人一狗的溫馨輪廓。何珮瑜更忍不住與愛犬親密互動，時而作狀親吻，時而將牠緊緊抱在胸前，人狗情深的畫面瞬間融化了眾多粉絲的心，網民紛紛留言羨慕何珮瑜的愛犬。</p>\n<img alt=\"近年何珮瑜收起性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c369b4e54017186864b698f52692383f/2023-05/293728735_143609465005205_6567398678419283940_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近年何珮瑜收起性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ae919e4bc1f3d52b8506e17ab9e87218/2023-05/134677713_3618854411565898_1746156795528782592_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近年何珮瑜收起性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97e88a22157241f1934b55b1b177bfd8/2023-05/260614023_674066003768020_4092402904549926268_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不過仍有繼續在社交網貼靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23e7178babe7898cae9f6693b5af7874/2023-05/271560753_1029408087658732_5426522452383097827_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不過仍有繼續在社交網貼靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/885e0ed9d9a763ded7427f62ecf2a2e7/2023-05/169917529_119648363531781_2949894127548304538_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不過仍有繼續在社交網貼靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da5ac4dc218798f2b68b06ea2810db93/2023-05/277418529_308860731304554_2253250380802258388_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近年何珮瑜參與過不少電影，與圈中前輩合作，圖為《一級指控》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/344c64cdaec1e1cfb201b7ab8b647c67/2023-05/l1370583.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在《神探大戰》飾演劉青雲女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89d946b904dcad0720582310da087068/2023-05/shentandazhan_day46_016_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"與昔日性感形象截然不同。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/09f94c8dede1a6e7fba416edca278117/2023-05/shentandazhan_day62_012_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在《風在起時》更與影帝梁朝偉合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68599df62e88b4936129eb600ab052f4/2023-05/02_4_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在《風在起時》更與影帝梁朝偉合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93791e141bd2ead421bbe6b8ee7126ad/2023-05/img_6592.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何珮瑜早前在IG大晒出海泳裝照！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e51b82230fd8aad31c26d35a2b353c78/2023-05/349499257_1386637748576866_3077101380596305514_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何珮瑜早前在IG大晒出海泳裝照！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11f1474567e73ca5c26c8473b38d9dad/2023-05/350110318_965623574878853_3497162745586355157_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"背光相大騷S型身材！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba8ef1c3abb271da5d5d67b145d8ca4b/2023-05/350235527_265093449344591_7620654028612629589_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"背光相大騷S型身材！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b1271a089a9734aebca81c3b310f32b/2023-05/350247848_259497113231723_2813593983379039916_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"另一輯相見到結實美臀！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/04311b82d5f0f1c3835a3bd26f275bb1/2023-05/349931716_709148804554390_8067028347234213503_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"另一輯相見到結實美臀！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d5889478e6f8c595b1f1001a29da610/2023-05/350129368_264866042579566_3512637316893451014_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"背多fun！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d14424cb058da7e4f26163b32b76aecc/2023-05/349956095_955988662212177_4647916389178709381_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"依然好靚女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd79b56763931a311a22ea189a389c19/2023-05/350123030_995946034738981_6551128235602955211_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"依然好靚女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2ee9106cbdb046bdc83980eda350059b/2023-05/350112845_206650272249407_3858049306594812965_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民個個睇到心心眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0133ba131c674de5f264aff1c5adca0f/2023-05/ed498ea7-830a-4e93-b61f-697a13a86271.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民仲話流鼻血流咗一晚！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b7b8863f07a4618425a6a9b0cc5fbbb/2023-05/00449e98-632f-4cb1-80c5-02c7e4ab59e2.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T05:12:02.083463+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":556,"images":37,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}